   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Chat emotes of your character\n**VTube Pro workflow, 8 GB graphics card** (SDXL). Pack 2026.10.01.\n\nLittle expressive faces of your character for Twitch, YouTube and Discord chat.\n\n## How to use it\n1. Load a close-up picture of your avatar in \"Your avatar\".\n2. Change the emotion in \"Your prompt\" (laughing, crying, love...).\n3. Press Run. You get four sizes with see-through backgrounds.\n4. Find the result in ComfyUI's **output/VTubePro** folder (or right-click the picture > Save Image).\n\nThe **green boxes** are the ones to change.\n\n**You get:** Transparent PNGs: 1024 px master plus 112, 56 and 28 px (Twitch sizes).\n\n**In VTube Pro:** Pose your avatar's face in the studio, take a picture, load it as \"Your avatar\". The emotes then match your model.\n\n**Settings:** 1024x1024, 28 steps, CFG 5, IP-Adapter 0.75 from your picture, BiRefNet cut-out.\n\n## Models (all allow commercial use)\n- [animagine-xl-4.0-opt.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/cagliostrolab/animagine-xl-4.0) (6.9 GB) in `models/checkpoints`: CreativeML Open RAIL++-M\n- [ip-adapter-plus_sdxl_vit-h.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/h94/IP-Adapter) (0.8 GB) in `models/ipadapter`: Apache-2.0\n- [CLIP-ViT-H-14-laion2B-s32B-b79K.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/h94/IP-Adapter) (2.5 GB) in `models/clip_vision`: Apache-2.0 (h94/IP-Adapter repo; the OpenCLIP ViT-H-14 weights are MIT)\n- [birefnet.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet) (0.4 GB) in `models/background_removal`: MIT\n\n## Custom node\n- [ComfyUI_IPAdapter_plus](https://github.com/cubiq/ComfyUI_IPAdapter_plus) at commit `a0f451a511` (GPL-3.0 (the node code; it runs inside your ComfyUI, VTube Pro does not ship it)). Install it with ComfyUI Manager (\"Install Missing Custom Nodes\"), then restart ComfyUI.\n\nMissing a model? ComfyUI offers to download it when you open this workflow. Or ask your AI: \n*\"Set up the VTube Pro emote workflow in ComfyUI\"*: the VTube Pro Helper downloads every file from its official page, checks it, and adds this workflow, after you say yes.\n\n## Tips\n- Check the 28 px one: if you can't read it that small, simplify.\n- Big expressions and thick outlines survive shrinking.\n- Each platform has its own emote rules: read them before uploading.\n- Make pictures when you are not live: picture AI slows face tracking."
   ],
   "title": "Start here",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
